    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-05: `--require-section` is documented to force inclusion of a named section under budget pressure. UAT tested below natural inclusion threshold and with bogus section names: zero observable effect either way. Either non-functional or silently ignored. Either fix the implementation or remove the flag from the CLI surface and docs."  # 5528
