- op: discuss  # c117
  at: '2026-04-14T16:18:09Z'  # c117
  by: agent  # c117
  actor: jgstern_agent  # c117
  clock: 3  # c117
  nonce: c117  # c117
  message: "Fixed in PR #3010. Root cause was that the flag was gated by 4 independent budget checks that all needed bypassing for the documented force-inclusion-under-budget semantics: (1) the early-return at max_tokens <= base_tokens, (2) the analysis pass gated on remaining_tokens > 50, (3) _section_ok's 0-threshold still failing at remaining<=0, (4) the final truncate_to_tokens chopping back to budget. All 4 now bypass when require_sections is non-empty — the overflow is accepted as the flag's cost. Verified on alertmanager: at -t 500 --require-section 'Key Symbols' 'Entry Points' now adds both sections; previously identical to no-flag."  # c117
